openbim.ifc 0.1.0 includes generated structural catalogs for IFC2x3 TC1,
IFC4 ADD2 TC1, and IFC4X3 ADD2.

Repository-authored Pkl contracts and tooling are licensed under
AGPL-3.0-or-later. The generated catalog rows are deterministic format shifts
of structural schema facts (entity names, ancestry, and inherited positional
attribute names) from the compiled `ifc-schema` artifacts at openbimrs/ifc
commit a7c4949bb941504ce874bdec13bd81d33491b5cb. Catalogs were exported
with `ifc-schema` commit 30b060f8dd7d3ceabfae3d4cd774fd7592d76f0f. No EXPRESS source or
specification prose is included.

Sources:
- IFC2x3 TC1: https://standards.buildingsmart.org/IFC/RELEASE/IFC2x3/TC1/HTML/
- IFC4 ADD2 TC1: https://standards.buildingsmart.org/IFC/RELEASE/IFC4/ADD2_TC1/HTML/
- IFC4X3 ADD2: https://standards.buildingsmart.org/IFC/RELEASE/IFC4_3/

